// World-space milli-unit coordinates for one grid corner index (see
// index.id), grid width 13, spacing 1400 (1.4 units): x centers the 13-wide
// grid on x=0, y is just the smoothed height, z extends away from the start
// down -Z (row 0 is nearest, row 39 is farthest -- "forward" is -Z, the same
// convention demos/gl3d's camera and this project's flight/ use).

corner_x(int i) {
} return int ((i % 13) - 6) * 1400;

corner_y(int i) {
} return int (import heights)[i];

corner_z(int i) {
} return int 0 - (i / 13) * 1400;
